                <invention-title lang="de">VORRICHTUNG ZUM ERWÄRMEN VON RAUCHBAREM MATERIAL UND ARTIKEL AUS RAUCHBAREM MATERIAL</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="fr">APPAREIL DE CHAUFFAGE DE MATÉRIAU À FUMER ET ARTICLE DE MATÉRIAU À FUMER</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">APPARATUS FOR HEATING SMOKABLE MATERIAL AND A METHOD OF IDENTIFYING AN ARTICLE OF SMOKABLE MATERIAL</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An apparatus (1) is provided for enabling smokable material to be heated to volatise at least one component of the smokable material. The apparatus (1) comprises a housing, and is configured to identify an article of smokable introduced into the housing in use. The apparatus (1) is also configured to only heat the article of smokable material if the article of smokable material is recognised by the apparatus, and is further configured to provide an indication to the user if the article of smokable material is not recognised.</p>
            </abstract>
